<title>TURKEY: Istanbul stock market closed for new year holiday.</title>
<headline>Istanbul stock market closed for new year holiday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Istanbul stock exchange was closed on Monday for an extended New Year holiday.</p>
<p>It will reopen on Thursday.</p>
</text>
